{"2727580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ash the Cat", "steam_appid": 2727580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark-humor 3D platforming adventure in the style of <strong>Conker's Bad Fur Day</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727580/extras/88c0700206acbf3de09ad45a421c6518.avif?t=1762963583\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727580/extras_big/88c0700206acbf3de09ad45a421c6518.avif?t=1762963583 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Ash in his noble quest of getting a date with his favorite female streamer! Overcome platforming challenges and witness absurd exchanges between Ash and all the other characters he encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727580/extras/60c56e32ee9cca87d7db9e2492c6fad4.avif?t=1762963583\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727580/extras_big/60c56e32ee9cca87d7db9e2492c6fad4.avif?t=1762963583 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a whack-or-be-whacked world, and Ash is NOT on top of the food chain, so try your best to avoid being smacked, crushed, sliced, burned, scalded or drowned as you try to reach the end of this story. It is said that energy drinks can keep him going for longer…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727580/extras/7680e7997b96e316b078e916d9f1edac.avif?t=1762963583\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727580/extras_big/7680e7997b96e316b078e916d9f1edac.avif?t=1762963583 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The single player story consists of five worlds, which should amount to about 4 hours of gameplay. Currently the game is in a “Vertical Slice” stage, meaning you get to play an alpha version of one of these worlds for free. Once you have a save file, you can skip to any part of the demo when starting a new game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now to not miss out on further developments!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark-humor 3D platforming adventure in the style of <strong>Conker's Bad Fur Day</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727580/extras/88c0700206acbf3de09ad45a421c6518.avif?t=1762963583\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727580/extras_big/88c0700206acbf3de09ad45a421c6518.avif?t=1762963583 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Ash in his noble quest of getting a date with his favorite female streamer! Overcome platforming challenges and witness absurd exchanges between Ash and all the other characters he encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727580/extras/60c56e32ee9cca87d7db9e2492c6fad4.avif?t=1762963583\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727580/extras_big/60c56e32ee9cca87d7db9e2492c6fad4.avif?t=1762963583 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a whack-or-be-whacked world, and Ash is NOT on top of the food chain, so try your best to avoid being smacked, crushed, sliced, burned, scalded or drowned as you try to reach the end of this story. It is said that energy drinks can keep him going for longer…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727580/extras/7680e7997b96e316b078e916d9f1edac.avif?t=1762963583\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727580/extras_big/7680e7997b96e316b078e916d9f1edac.avif?t=1762963583 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The single player story consists of five worlds, which should amount to about 4 hours of gameplay. Currently the game is in a “Vertical Slice” stage, meaning you get to play an alpha version of one of these worlds for free. Once you have a save file, you can skip to any part of the demo when starting a new game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now to not miss out on further developments!</p>", "short_description": "A dark-humor 3D platforming adventure in the style of Conker's Bad Fur Day.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727580/8555cad896bee96309b2406f5fa8a579b6224285/header.jpg?t=1762963583", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727580/5f7c0d22c27f33ee6c799ab10e2a6f4a3e4686ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762963583", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727580/5f7c0d22c27f33ee6c799ab10e2a6f4a3e4686ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762963583", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-2500 3.3GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GTS450 / AMD Radeon 6850HD<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><